ABOUT HOSPITAL

Jaya Multispeciality Hospital is a trusted healthcare institution in Boduppal, Hyderabad, providing affordable and high-quality medical care. The hospital offers expert treatment across Orthopaedics, General Medicine, Critical Care, Obstetrics & Gynecology, Pediatrics, and Urology.

The hospital is committed to patient-centered healthcare with experienced doctors, modern facilities, emergency services, diagnostic support, and compassionate treatment.

